cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cognarc Core in research or in a system you describe publicly, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Cognarc Core: a decision-record contract and PostgreSQL ledger primitives"
abstract: >-
  A decision-record contract plus PostgreSQL primitives (tenant isolation with forced row-level
  security, idempotent writes and append-only audit tables) that make who decided what, when,
  under which policy, and what happened next traceable and tamper-resistant by construction.
authors:
